WEBVTT

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:09.070
Morning!

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:10.770
You’re late.

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:14.240
Sorry, sorry.
My alarm clock wasn’t working.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:18.450
That alarm clock seems to have
been that way for a long time.

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:21.410
Seems that way...

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.120
It’s alright. Hurry up and change.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.500
Right.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:36.300
Ryou.

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:41.810
Now, everything’s ready.

00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:46.770
Good morning!

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:48.070
Don’t worry about opening.

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:53.200
From now on, don’t worry about opening the shop.

00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:00.280
Vacation?!

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:03.570
We’re taking a vacation from the shop for a little while.

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:05.950
Wait a second. What’s going on?

00:01:05.950 --> 00:01:06.750
What she said.

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:08.960
Please explain properly.

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:11.960
What she said. If I can’t get any tips,
I’ll have some trouble.

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:16.680
Shirogane-san.

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:18.590
Come.

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:32.320
This is the same energy response that occurred at Omotesando and Sumida River.

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:36.610
This response is being observed
over various places in Tokyo.

00:01:37.310 --> 00:01:39.640
The difference between this case
and the previous ones is...

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:45.160
...that even though there is a response, a definite phenomenon hasn’t occurred yet.

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:50.130
And this response grows day by day.

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:51.540
In other words...

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:56.090
Something big might happen soon.

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:59.340
You mean the decisive battle
is coming up?

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:02.260
That might be it.

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:10.230
If you just look at the series of movements,
I don’t think the aliens are plotting this.

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:11.810
It doesn’t matter what it is.

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:14.240
What I’m saying is,
we’ll have to be prepared soon.

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:18.790
Before that we thought it would be good to take a break from the shop

00:02:18.790 --> 00:02:20.700
and let you get refreshed.

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:25.120
I’m sorry...

00:02:29.240 --> 00:02:30.710
Shirogane.

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:37.680
If we had more power... you wouldn’t
have to do these things...

00:02:40.420 --> 00:02:41.340
It’s been a while...

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:46.430
It’s been a while... An entire day off.

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:48.520
Zakuro-san...

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:52.980
Now that you mention it,
it’s been busy here for a while.

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:54.940
It really has been.

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:59.450
I’ll take you up on your offer and have a peaceful time.

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:02.110
Alright! I’m going to play till I drop!

00:03:24.730 --> 00:03:26.770
It became quiet all of a sudden.

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:28.430
Ummm...

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:32.110
Retasu?

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:37.610
You didn’t leave yet?

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:43.110
Ummm. You just abruptly told us to take a vacation, but I didn’t know what to do.

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:51.080
Besides... I thought it would be a waste if nobody ate these cakes with the shop closed.

00:03:53.740 --> 00:03:54.540
That makes sense.

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:56.750
Okay.

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:01.130
It’s delicious.

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:05.340
Yeah. Did you make this?

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:09.640
No. Ummm. I just helped out...

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:12.600
Delicious.

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:47.550
Chincha, Hanacha, Ruucha, Honcha, Heicha, I’m home!

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:50.510
Welcome back!

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:50.510
Welcome back!

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:50.510
Welcome back!

00:04:50.840 --> 00:04:53.140
Bu-Ling-oneechan, what about the shop?

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:55.440
Today became a day off.

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:58.480
Then all day today...?

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:00.150
We can play, yes!

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:10.030
Baaya?

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:11.820
What is it?

00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:14.740
What if... This is just a what if.

00:05:14.740 --> 00:05:20.670
If you knew the Earth would be destroyed
tomorrow, what would you do?

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:23.130
So that’s what you want to know.

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:32.560
I would definitely spend the day doing
the same thing I do all the time.

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:54.150
Ah, not here?

00:05:54.150 --> 00:05:57.830
Umm... Is Aoyama-kun here today?

00:05:57.830 --> 00:06:00.540
Now that you mention it,
I don’t think he came.

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:03.250
Umm... Does he have a cold
or something?

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:07.590
I don’t think he told anyone, so I’m not sure.

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:11.510
But it is strange for Aoyama to take
a break and not tell anyone.

00:06:20.930 --> 00:06:22.230
Aoyama-kun.

00:06:46.790 --> 00:06:48.340
What’s the meaning of this, Quiche?

00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:50.840
What do you mean?

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:53.550
You said the Blue Knight is our savior.

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:55.140
Ah, that.

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:58.230
Why are you acting all big?

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:01.270
I have a proposal for the two of you.

00:07:02.140 --> 00:07:03.430
Proposal?

00:07:03.430 --> 00:07:06.060
Instead of waiting for Deep Blue’s awakening,

00:07:06.060 --> 00:07:08.610
I was thinking we should take the Blue Knight’s power.

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:09.240
What?!

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:16.200
You saw it when he unleashed his
energy. His power is serious.

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:23.300
If we use it, we might be able to restore our
home planet without relying on Deep Blue.

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:36.310
What do you think?
Will you do as I suggest?

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:40.190
Quiche. You...

00:07:40.610 --> 00:07:41.890
What’s wrong, Pie?

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:44.810
You understand what you are saying, right?

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:45.900
That’s right.

00:07:47.770 --> 00:07:49.860
Tart, what are you going to do?

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:51.480
I’ll help you!

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:52.070
Tart!

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:56.410
If what Quiche says is true, then
we can save our home planet.

00:07:57.530 --> 00:07:59.750
What will you do, Pie?

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:10.470
No matter what happens, I will follow
Deep Blue-sama until the end.

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:12.260
Is that so?

00:08:13.250 --> 00:08:15.100
I thought that’s what you’d say.

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:22.900
Then next time we meet, we might be enemies.

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:28.190
That’s fine. I’ll leave it up to you.

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:30.070
Later.

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:36.030
Fools!

00:08:46.910 --> 00:08:49.460
Hello, Aoyama-kun?!

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:51.430
Aoyama-kun’s mother.

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:53.550
That... No... Yes...

00:08:57.840 --> 00:09:01.230
Aoyama-kun is missing?!

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:18.200
I was wondering what you were doing when you were hiding yourself.

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:19.780
This is what you were up to.

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:23.750
That’s right.
I wasn’t just playing around.

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:26.450
With these, they don’t stand a chance.

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:29.250
The real target is the Blue Knight.

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:34.720
These guys will be used as a decoy to keep Ichigo and the Blue Knight from coming together.

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:36.300
Decoy?

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:42.770
Before the Blue Knight transforms,
we attack. We will take his spirit.

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:46.850
If we have his spirit,
we don’t need his body.

00:09:51.230 --> 00:09:56.240
Aoyama-kun. Where are you?
Aoyama-kun.

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:07.540
Let the show begin!

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:30.690
What just happened, Keiichirou?

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:34.150
All around the center of the city,
a huge number of Chimera Animas.

00:10:34.620 --> 00:10:37.530
This... An unbelievable number!

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:42.950
Then this is what that energy response was for?

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:45.200
No, that’s not it.

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:45.830
What?!

00:10:47.050 --> 00:10:50.290
The energy response we talked about before is still there.

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:52.250
What’s going on?

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:55.210
I don’t know, but we can’t leave this as it is...

00:10:56.830 --> 00:10:57.630
Ryou!

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:01.050
Contact everyone.

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:02.660
After you confirm their
present positions,

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:05.130
split the areas up and have the Chimera Animas cleaned out.

00:11:05.130 --> 00:11:05.640
Okay.

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:08.560
Shit! What’s going on?

00:11:12.220 --> 00:11:16.320
Umm... I’m going to go out.

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:21.400
I’m counting on you.

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:22.280
Alright!

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:28.120
A huge number of Chimera Animas
has appeared all over Tokyo.

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:32.640
They number about five hundred. This battle will be like nothing you’ve faced before.

00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:36.210
If you use your full power,
you can definitely win.

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:41.970
Everyone, I just got some good black tea.

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:45.430
Afterwards, I’ll make it for you, so please make sure to come back.

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:48.890
Tokyo Mew Mew, GO!!

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:53.690
Mew Mew Mint METAMORPHO-SE!

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:07.500
Oh... he’s such a slave driver!

00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:12.500
Mew Mew Lettuce METAMORPHO-SE!

00:12:23.460 --> 00:12:24.800
What numbers!

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:29.980
Mew Mew Pudding METAMORPHO-SE!

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:42.780
You can come attack from anywhere!

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:48.290
Mew Mew Pomegranate METAMORPHO-SE!

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:00.380
Here I go!

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:03.590
<i>Akasaka-san, Shirogane.</i>

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:06.090
Ichigo, you know the situation?

00:13:06.090 --> 00:13:08.160
<i>I know, I know, but...</i>

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:08.810
What?

00:13:08.810 --> 00:13:13.020
<i>Aoyama-kun went missing.
He’s not anywhere.</i>

00:13:13.470 --> 00:13:14.230
What?!

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:24.150
I finally found you.

00:13:28.690 --> 00:13:31.410
I came to serve you, Blue Knight.

00:13:32.550 --> 00:13:33.750
Just kidding.

00:13:38.870 --> 00:13:41.760
I’m taking your spirit.

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:47.640
Reborn Mint Echo!

00:13:52.090 --> 00:13:55.400
Reborn Lettuce Rush!

00:13:59.430 --> 00:14:03.780
Reborn PuddingRings Inferno!

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:11.500
Reborn Pomegran’ Spear!

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:21.710
Quiche...

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:27.380
Is it possible...?

00:14:30.670 --> 00:14:32.030
Emergency communication!

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:34.810
While cleaning up all of the Chimera Animas, search for Aoyama.

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:36.770
The enemy’s target is Aoyama!

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:38.730
What is this?

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:44.150
Even if you tell us to search for
Aoyama-san while fighting...

00:14:50.440 --> 00:14:51.870
Get out of my way!

00:14:52.860 --> 00:14:56.550
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:55.220
Reborn Strawberry Surprise!

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:16.240
The spirit won’t come out.

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:18.240
What’s happening?

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:28.920
What’s this? This pressure...?

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:35.340
It just appeared.
It’s the Blue Knight’s response.

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:36.470
Are you sure?

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:39.760
Yes. It was just for a moment, but
it was a huge energy response.

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:42.100
Without a doubt,
it was the Blue Knight’s.

00:16:42.540 --> 00:16:43.350
I’m sending out the data.

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:46.310
Everyone, please quickly head to this location.

00:16:46.660 --> 00:16:48.190
Understood.

00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:53.320
We have to rush there! This attack is clearly different from everything before.

00:16:55.480 --> 00:16:58.820
Aoyama-kun. Aoyama-kun. Aoyama-kun.

00:16:58.820 --> 00:17:00.660
Aoyama-kun!

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:13.800
Hey Quiche!

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:16.550
I said “Quiche!”

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:20.100
Let’s take this guy.

00:17:22.010 --> 00:17:26.980
We can’t do it now, but there must
be a way to take his spirit.

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:30.940
We will save... our home planet.

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:32.320
Tart.

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:35.700
Aoyama-kun!

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:44.490
Ichigo.

00:17:46.740 --> 00:17:47.790
Don’t touch him!

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:49.250
What?

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:51.960
You heard me, I said:
“Don’t touch Aoyama-kun!”

00:17:53.750 --> 00:17:54.880
Aoyama-kun!

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:10.190
Aoyama-kun?

00:18:41.630 --> 00:18:44.310
Wh... What is this?

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:49.430
The huge energy from the accumulated Mew Aqua all over the various parts of the city...

00:18:50.310 --> 00:18:52.110
...has begun to gather in one location.

00:18:53.790 --> 00:18:57.700
The location is... the Blue Knight’s position!

00:18:58.730 --> 00:19:02.700
Shit! Again. Once more.

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:08.370
After all... we couldn’t stop anything?

00:19:24.750 --> 00:19:25.480
Ichigo!

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:27.140
This is...

00:19:27.750 --> 00:19:29.520
What’s happening?

00:19:40.460 --> 00:19:42.950
Aoyama-kun?

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:05.010
Aoyama... kun?

00:20:08.590 --> 00:20:11.520
I am known as Deep Blue.

00:20:12.970 --> 00:20:15.870
I will become the ruler of this planet.

00:20:18.260 --> 00:20:21.490
It’s not true. It can’t be true.

00:20:25.130 --> 00:20:28.500
It’s not true.
Aoyama-kun was Deep Blue.

00:20:28.500 --> 00:20:31.450
Ichigo, this is reality.

00:20:31.450 --> 00:20:34.790
That’s right. This is a bad dream.

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:38.790
Once I wake up, the usual and kind Aoyama-kun...

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:41.170
Get with it! No matter who you think that is,

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:44.100
what’s certain is that he plans to mess up the Earth.

00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:47.730
Next: “Ichigo’s Trial: I am a Mew Mew”

00:20:47.730 --> 00:20:52.110
That’s right. You have to fight for the one you love.
